    "# ============================================================\n",
    "# STEP 11 : TRAIN XGBOOST REGRESSOR\n",
    "# ============================================================\n",
    "\n",
    "This STEP trains the XGBoost Regressor using the combined feature matrix.\n",
    "\n",
    "The model learns the relationship between:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Shallow Linguistic Features\n",
    "- Essay Complexity Features\n",
    "- OpenAI Embeddings\n",
    "\n",
    "and the human-assigned essay scores.\n",
    "\n",
    "The trained model will later be used for prediction and evaluation."
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "id": "v5o24nKT9qPS"
   }
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "# ============================================================\n",
    "# STEP 11 : TRAIN XGBOOST MODEL\n",
    "# ============================================================\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 70)\n",
    "print(\"TRAINING XGBOOST REGRESSOR\")\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 70)\n",
    "\n",
    "xgb_model = XGBRegressor(\n",
    "\n",
    "    objective=\"reg:squarederror\",\n",
    "\n",
    "    n_estimators=300,\n",
    "\n",
    "    max_depth=8,\n",
    "\n",
    "    learning_rate=0.05,\n",
    "\n",
    "    subsample=0.8,\n",
    "\n",
    "    colsample_bytree=0.8,\n",
    "\n",
    "    random_state=42,\n",
    "\n",
    "    n_jobs=-1\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "xgb_model.fit(X_train, y_train)\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"\\nModel training completed successfully.\")\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"=\" * 70)"
   ],
   "metadata": {
