    "# ============================================================\n",
    "# STEP 12 : MODEL EVALUATION\n",
    "# ============================================================\n",
    "\n",
    "This STEP evaluates the performance of the trained XGBoost model.\n",
    "\n",
    "The following evaluation metrics are computed:\n",
    "\n",
    "- Mean Absolute Error (MAE)\n",
    "- Root Mean Squared Error (RMSE)\n",
    "- Spearman Rank Correlation\n",
    "- Quadratic Weighted Kappa (QWK)\n",
    "\n",
    "Quadratic Weighted Kappa (QWK) is the primary evaluation metric used in\n",
    "Automated Essay Scoring research because it measures agreement between\n",
    "predicted scores and human-assigned scores while accounting for the degree\n",
    "of disagreement."
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "id": "GfJzSRGyAARD"
   }
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "source": [
    "# ============================================================\n",
    "# STEP 12 : IMPORT EVALUATION METRICS\n",
    "# ============================================================\n",
    "\n",
    "from sklearn.metrics import (\n",
    "    mean_absolute_error,\n",
    "    mean_squared_error,\n",
    "    cohen_kappa_score\n",
    ")\n",
    "\n",
    "from scipy.stats import spearmanr\n",
    "\n",
    "print(\"Evaluation metrics imported successfully.\")"
   ],
   "metadata": {
    "colab": {
     "base_uri": "https://localhost:8080/"
    },
    "id": "jQKRwi-MADXL",
    "outputId": "be726b82-08da-43d0-ee23-85ade0bc3ad8"
   },
